# `reporting/writeups/` — Internal written updates & reports

Prose that isn't a manuscript: lab-meeting writeups, quarterly progress, funder
reports, internal analysis summaries. One folder per writeup, named by period:
`YYYY-Qn-slug/` or `YYYY-MM-slug/`.

## Keep it lightweight
Writeups are **Markdown → LaTeX** (`writeup.md`) so producing one stays a
two-minute job, not a formatting chore. They still build with the shared
`../_assets/` style, so they look consistent with papers and slides.

- Reference figures from `../../results/figures/light/`; don't copy.
- Point-in-time — write a new one, don't overwrite the last.

If a writeup starts growing into a manuscript, graduate it to
[`../papers/`](../papers/README.md).
